#: chaotic_pfc.comms.metrics.comm_metrics:3 of
msgid ""
"``m_hat[n]`` is assumed to reproduce ``m[n - delay]``, so the samples "
"compared are ``m[n]`` against ``m_hat[n + delay]`` for ``n >= "
"transient``. The *transient* value itself is not modified; the alignment "
"only shifts the comparison window."
msgstr ""
"``m_hat[n]`` is assumed to reproduce ``m[n - delay]``, so the samples "
"compared are ``m[n]`` against ``m_hat[n + delay]`` for ``n >= "
"transient``. The *transient* value itself is not modified; the alignment "
"only shifts the comparison window."



